# Day 32 – Think Like a Marketing Strategist

## 📌 Project
Today I explored how AI can help create effective marketing strategies by understanding the audience before creating content. Instead of randomly posting on social media, I learned to build structured marketing plans using AI.

---

## 🎯 Objective

Build a Marketing Strategy Simulator that helps users:

- Identify the target audience
- Select the right marketing platforms
- Create content pillars
- Generate a 30-day marketing roadmap
- Handle real-world marketing events
- Review overall growth performance

---

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- Claude AI
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

---

## 📚 Key Learnings

- Audience research is the foundation of every marketing strategy.
- Different platforms serve different business goals.
- Content pillars help maintain consistent branding.
- AI can generate complete marketing roadmaps in seconds.
- Prompt engineering improves AI-generated marketing plans.

---

## 🚀 Features

- Audience Analysis
- Platform Selection
- Content Strategy Generator
- 30-Day Marketing Planner
- Marketing Event Simulation
- Growth Report Dashboard
- Reusable AI Prompts

